.TH "Docv::Layout::Piece" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::Layout::Piece \- A word, a run of blanks or a tab, ready to be placed.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBstruct Docv::Layout::Piece\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
A word, a run of blanks or a tab, ready to be placed. A word with
linked text has the \fB\%Span#link\fR of each of its cells in \fIlinks\fR.
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
\fBdef self.new(kind : Docv::Layout::Piece::Kind, cells : Array(Docv::Cell) = [] of Cell, text : String = "", offset : Int32 = 0, count : Int32 = 0, links : Nil | Array(Int32) = nil)\fR
